    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBeautifully Presented Two-Bedroom Own-Door Apartment with Private Landscaped Garden\n\nHooke & MacDonald are delighted to present this beautifully presented two-bedroom, ground-floor own-door apartment, ideally positioned within the popular Stonebridge Wood development in Shankill. Extending to approximately 80 sq. m. (861 sq. ft.), the property benefits from an A-rated energy efficiency and includes one designated car parking space.\n\nThe property enjoys a bright and spacious layout, with a welcoming entrance hall leading to a generous open-plan kitchen, dining and living space. The living area opens directly onto a private front terrace.\n\nThe principal bedroom is a feature of the property, with direct access to a private landscaped, low-maintenance garden. This generous outdoor space is an excellent extension of the accommodation and a rare benefit for apartment living. The principal bedroom also benefits from a modern en-suite.\n\nThe accommodation further comprises a second generous double bedroom, main bathroom, separate utility room and two useful storage rooms, providing excellent storage throughout the property.\n\nStonebridge Wood is conveniently located close to Shankill village, with its excellent selection of shops, cafés and local amenities. The DART station, schools, Shankill Beach and Shanganagh Park are also within easy reach, while Dublin city centre is readily accessible by both public transport and road.\n\nThe combination of excellent condition, generous 80 sq. m. accommodation, an A-rated energy efficiency and two private outdoor spaces, including the landscaped garden, makes this a particularly attractive apartment within Stonebridge Wood."
      },
